  \item \textbf{Resource-Efficient Fine-Tuning:} Our approach freezes the majority of the diffusion network and updates only a small set of parameters in the Q--probe, significantly reducing computational and memory requirements during fine-tuning.
  \item \textbf{Modular and Interpretable Framework:} QD\textsuperscript{2}P offers a transparent, stepwise mechanism for reward correction via candidate reweighting, facilitating easier debugging, calibration, and integration of modern distillation techniques.
